# Chaos Under the Microscope

The recurrence $x_{n+1}=4x_n(1-x_n)$ is sensitive, but sensitivity is not one-wayness. Begin with the exact numerical tour below, then use the widgets to expose the map’s hidden structure. For background, see the [logistic map](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Logistic_map), [semiconjugacy](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Topological_conjugacy), and [pseudorandom generator](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pseudorandom_number_generator) overviews.

